WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.280
I'm Jayna, I'm 35 and I joined Blueprint because I was training at another gym in the

00:00:06.280 --> 00:00:12.760
area and was getting much better in terms of my cardio fitness if I wasn't getting stronger

00:00:12.760 --> 00:00:14.320
in the ways that I wanted to.

00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:19.960
I joined Blueprint about six months ago, so back in April, and since then I've got so

00:00:19.960 --> 00:00:26.240
much stronger and feel much more confident and have less pain in my body.

00:00:26.240 --> 00:00:31.880
I also have a much better sense of nutrition and how much my nutrition impacts my training

00:00:31.880 --> 00:00:33.880
and my ability to get stronger.

00:00:33.880 --> 00:00:36.840
Blueprint is honestly my happy place.

00:00:36.840 --> 00:00:42.400
I always enjoy coming here, everybody, all the instructors are so friendly and knowledgeable

00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:49.000
and somehow know everything about where I was last week and where I want to get to.

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:54.280
In terms of three words that I would use to describe Blueprint, supportive, challenging

00:00:54.280 --> 00:00:54.680
and fun.

